    ],
    "summary": "A deterministic storm through the book: mean loss and its spread from damage uncertainty, net of the treaty, where it falls on the occurrence curve, the losses on a map, and how much it matters exactly where it lands",
    "operationId": "stress_test_v1_stress_tests_post",
